        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "44-5-2 Teachers new to the District will be given one (1) experience step (as defined in Section 44-5) for each year of teaching experience outside the District, to a maximum of seven (7) years; the District may grant up to an additional three (3) years of experience, as determined by 44-5, at its discretion. This language is effective starting the 2001-02 school year and is not retroactive to previous years.",
            "block_bbox": [
                95,
                1177,
