        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "44-5-2-2 Retired teachers who fill assignments will be placed at the educational level they were when they retired and on step 11 of the salary schedule if they return to a teaching position that is equivalent to a contracted position (a full semester or longer than ninety (90) days in one assignment). Long-term substitute positions are not subject to this provision.",
